  ["Could not save bug report file.\n\nPlease check that /tmp or /var has free space, then try again."] = "无法保存错误报告文件。\n\n请确认 /tmp 或 /var 有可用空间，然后重试。",
  ["Bug report module failed to load.\n\nRun generate-report.sh via SSH or the terminal emulator instead."] = "错误报告模块加载失败。\n\n请改为通过 SSH 或终端模拟器运行 generate-report.sh。",
  ["\n\nConnect your device via USB to retrieve the file. Please share it when reporting issues on GitHub."] = "\n\n请通过 USB 连接设备以获取该文件。上报问题时请将其分享到 GitHub。",
  ["Checks GitHub for a newer release. If an update is available, downloads and installs it. Requires Wi-Fi."] = "在 GitHub 上检查更新的版本。若有更新，将下载并安装。需要 Wi-Fi。",
  ["Piper is synthesizing slower than playback (%1x realtime).\nApplying %2 to compensate (this session only)."] = "Piper 合成速度慢于播放速度（实时率的 %1 倍）。\n已应用 %2 进行补偿（仅本次会话）。",
  ["Uses the system default ALSA device, then falls back to tts_sm and plughw:0 if the default is unavailable."] = "使用系统默认 ALSA 设备；若默认不可用，则回退到 tts_sm 与 plughw:0。",
  ["\n\nConnect your device via USB to retrieve the file. Share it on GitHub to help document device performance."] = "\n\n请通过 USB 连接设备以获取该文件，并分享到 GitHub，帮助我们记录设备性能表现。",
  ["Piper is still synthesizing.\nFor faster playback, switch to the espeak backend in Tools → Audiobook → TTS Engine."] = "Piper 仍在合成中。\n为获得更快的播放速度，请在 工具 → 有声书 → TTS 引擎 中切换到 espeak 后端。",
  ["No audio files available for this item.\n\nThe server may not have scanned this book yet, or the files may be missing."] = "此条目没有可用的音频文件。\n\n服务器可能尚未扫描该书，或文件已缺失。",
  ["Positive values delay the highlight (use when the highlight runs ahead of the narration); negative values advance it."] = "正值延后高亮（高亮领先旁白时使用）；负值提前高亮。",
  ["This book has no built-in audiobook. Use Play unaligned audiobook or Start music playlist to play a separate audio file."] = "本书没有内置有声书。请使用“播放未对齐的有声书”或“开始音乐播放列表”播放单独音频文件。",
  ["Shows plugin version, KOReader version, device model, active TTS backend, and audio player. Useful when reporting issues."] = "显示插件版本、KOReader 版本、设备型号、当前 TTS 后端和音频播放器。反馈问题时很有用。",
  ["The Android TTS engine stopped. Neural voices can be killed for memory; open the TTS app once, then start read-aloud again."] = "Android TTS 引擎已停止。神经语音可能因内存被终止；请打开一次 TTS 应用，再重新开始跟读。",
  ["Bug report generation failed.\n\nThis usually means temporary storage (/var) is full. Please reboot your Kindle and try again."] = "错误报告生成失败。\n\n这通常意味着临时存储（/var）已满。请重启你的 Kindle 后重试。",
  ["When enabled, TTS and playback audio are saved as WAV files in the audio/ folder. When disabled, only the video file is kept."] = "启用后，TTS 与播放音频将以 WAV 文件保存在 audio/ 文件夹。关闭时仅保留视频文件。",
  ["When enabled, the mini audiobook bar stays on screen after you stop narration. When disabled (default), the bar hides when idle."] = "启用后，迷你有声书栏在停止旁白后仍留在屏幕上。关闭（默认）时，空闲时该栏隐藏。",
  ["Kindle native TTS failed.\n\nThe text-to-speech engine could not produce audio. Please generate a bug report and share it on GitHub."] = "Kindle 原生 TTS 失败。\n\n文字转语音引擎未能生成音频。请生成错误报告并分享到 GitHub。",
  ["Japanese voice for sanoTTS: two files, ~14 MB total, from the sanoTTS-jp v1.0.0 release (MIT). The plugin bundles none of this data."] = "sanoTTS 的日语语音：两个文件，共约 14 MB，来自 sanoTTS-jp v1.0.0 发行版（MIT）。插件不包含这些数据。",
  ["Kindle native TTS failed.\n\nThe text-to-speech helper binary could not be executed. Please generate a bug report and share it on GitHub."] = "Kindle 原生 TTS 失败。\n\n文字转语音辅助程序无法执行。请生成错误报告并分享到 GitHub。",
  ["Piper server failed to start (timeout).\nNeural TTS may be too heavy for this device.\nSwitch to the espeak backend for reliable playback."] = "Piper 服务启动失败（超时）。\n神经网络 TTS 对此设备可能过重。\n请切换到 espeak 后端以获得稳定播放。",
  ["No audio output available.\n\nKobo has no built-in speaker.\n\nPlease pair Bluetooth headphones:\nSettings → Bluetooth → Pair\n\nThen try again."] = "没有可用的音频输出。\n\nKobo 没有内置扬声器。\n\n请配对蓝牙耳机：\n设置 → 蓝牙 → 配对\n\n然后重试。",
  ["Playback unavailable. The media player failed to initialize. Please restart KOReader and, if the problem persists, generate a bug report."] = "无法播放。媒体播放器初始化失败。请重启 KOReader；若问题依旧，请生成错误报告。",
  ["Records the current audiobook or TTS session. Audio, video/screenshots, and optional touch events are saved to a folder on device storage."] = "录制当前的 audiobook 或 TTS 会话。音频、视频/截图以及可选的触摸事件将保存到设备存储的文件夹中。",
  ["This device is too slow for Piper voices.\nSwitching to espeak for this session.\nPiper will be tried again the next time you start playback."] = "此设备太慢，无法流畅使用 Piper 语音。\n本次会话将切换到 espeak。\n下次开始播放时会再次尝试 Piper。",
  ["Routes through the PocketBook audio daemon (softvol, dmix, resampling). Best compatibility on devices that expose tts_sm in /etc/asound.conf."] = "经由 PocketBook 音频守护进程（softvol、dmix、重采样）路由。在 /etc/asound.conf 中暴露 tts_sm 的设备上兼容性最佳。",
  ["Audio playback failed on this Kindle model.\n\nThe ttssrc TTS pipeline could not start. Please generate a bug report and share it on the GitHub issue."] = "此 Kindle 机型音频播放失败。\n\nttssrc TTS 管线无法启动。请生成错误报告并分享到 GitHub 问题页。",
  ["No Bluetooth headphones detected.\n\nThis Kindle has no built-in speaker. Connect Bluetooth headphones in Settings → Wi-Fi & Bluetooth before playing."] = "未检测到蓝牙耳机。\n\n此 Kindle 没有内置扬声器。播放前请在设置 → Wi-Fi 与蓝牙中连接蓝牙耳机。",
  ["Piper neural TTS servers stopped responding.\nThis often happens on devices with limited RAM or CPU.\nSwitch to the espeak backend for reliable playback."] = "Piper 神经网络 TTS 服务停止响应。\n这常发生在内存或 CPU 有限的设备上。\n请切换到 espeak 后端以获得稳定播放。",
  ["No TTS engine available.\n\nOn Kobo/Kindle, install espeak-ng or use the pre-built release.\nOn Android, TTS is not yet supported.\n\nSee README for details."] = "没有可用的 TTS 引擎。\n\n在 Kobo/Kindle 上，请安装 espeak-ng 或使用预编译版本。\n在 Android 上暂不支持 TTS。\n\n详见 README。",
  ["Session recording is starting.\n\nIt will stop automatically when the screen locks or the device turns off. You can also stop it from the Diagnostics menu."] = "会话录制已开始。\n\n屏幕锁定或设备关机时将自动停止。你也可以从诊断菜单手动停止。",
  ["Android TTS: no voice available for %1.\nInstall the matching voice data in Android's Text-to-speech settings, or pick a different language in Voice settings."] = "Android TTS：没有适用于 %1 的语音。\n请在 Android 的文字转语音设置中安装对应语音数据，或在语音设置中选择其他语言。",
  ["This book has no embedded narration.\n\nPlace an audiobook file with the same name in the same folder, or use Play unaligned audiobook to play a separate file."] = "本书没有内嵌旁白。\n\n请将同名的有声书文件放在同一文件夹中，或使用“播放未对齐的有声书”来播放单独的文件。",
  ["No audio output available.\n\nNo supported audio player found (aplay, paplay, mpv, mplayer).\n\nIf using Bluetooth, make sure headphones are paired and connected."] = "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n未找到支持的音频播放器（aplay、paplay、mpv、mplayer）。\n\n若使用蓝牙，请确保耳机已完成配对并连接。",
  ["No audio output available.\n\nOn this PocketBook, direct ALSA playback can damage the audio subsystem. Please connect Bluetooth headphones first, then try again."] = "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n在此 PocketBook 上，直接 ALSA 播放可能损坏音频子系统。请先连接蓝牙耳机，再重试。",
  ["No audio from %1 after a long wait.\n\nThis e-reader is probably too slow for that on-device neural engine. Open the TTS app once, or switch to another system voice."] = "等待很久后 %1 仍无音频。\n\n这台电子阅读器可能太慢，跑不动该本地神经网络引擎。请先打开一次 TTS 应用，或改用其他系统语音。",
  ["Shifts EPUB Media Overlay sentence highlighting relative to the audio. Some audiobooks (e.g. with publisher intros) have timing tables offset from the embedded audio."] = "相对音频偏移 EPUB 媒体覆盖层的句子高亮。部分有声书（如含出版商前言的）其时间轴与内嵌音频存在偏移。",
  ["TTS synthesis failed.\n\nCould not generate audio file.\n\nCommon causes:\n• The TTS engine is not installed\n• /tmp or /var is full (reboot to clear)\n• Insufficient free memory"] = "TTS 合成失败。\n\n无法生成音频文件。\n\n常见原因：\n• TTS 引擎未安装\n• /tmp 或 /var 已满（重启以清理）\n• 可用内存不足",
  ["Uses the PocketBook InkView PlayFile API. Some firmwares (PB740, PB631) export PlayFile but do not actually play audio; if no sound comes out, switch back to tts_sm or Auto."] = "使用 PocketBook InkView PlayFile API。部分固件（PB740、PB631）导出 PlayFile 但实际不播放音频；若无声音，请切回 tts_sm 或自动。",
  ["Download incomplete: expected %1 bytes, got %2.\n\nPlease try again, or install manually: download the release zip from GitHub and copy audiobook.koplugin to your plugins folder."] = "下载不完整：预期 %1 字节，实际收到 %2 字节。\n\n请重试，或手动安装：从 GitHub 下载发布压缩包，并将 audiobook.koplugin 复制到你的插件目录。",
  ["Note: this device has limited CPU/RAM. Piper voices may pause between sentences or fall back to espeak during playback. Enabling \"Low-resource mode\" in Voice settings can help."] = "注意：此设备 CPU/内存有限。Piper 语音可能在句间停顿，或在播放时回退到 espeak。在语音设置中开启“低资源模式”可有所帮助。",
  ["When enabled, the recorder tries to mux ALSA audio into the video file in real time. This requires a working ALSA capture device and fails on most e-ink devices, so it is disabled."] = "启用后，录制器会尝试将 ALSA 音频实时混入视频文件。这需要可用的 ALSA 采集设备，在大多数墨水屏设备上会失败，因此默认关闭。",
  ["Kindle native TTS failed.\n\nThe device has a TTS engine (Ivona SDK) but playback could not be triggered via any strategy (FFI and shell).\n\nPlease generate a bug report and share it on GitHub."] = "Kindle 原生 TTS 失败。\n\n设备具备 TTS 引擎（Ivona SDK），但通过任何方式（FFI 与 shell）都无法触发播放。\n\n请生成错误报告并分享到 GitHub。",
  ["Bluetooth audio not connected.\n\nPlease make sure your Bluetooth headphones or speaker are:\n\n1. Powered on\n2. Paired in Kobo Settings → Bluetooth\n3. Connected and within range\n\nThen try again."] = "蓝牙音频未连接。\n\n请确认你的蓝牙耳机或音箱：\n\n1. 已开机\n2. 已在 Kobo 设置 → 蓝牙中完成配对\n3. 已连接且在有效范围内\n\n然后重试。",
  ["Direct hardware access through the ALSA plug layer. On some PocketBooks (e.g. PB631) the plug layer does not actually resample; if you hear playback at 2-3x speed, switch back to tts_sm or Auto."] = "通过 ALSA plug 层直接访问硬件。部分 PocketBook（如 PB631）的 plug 层实际不重采样；若听到 2-3 倍速播放，请切回 tts_sm 或自动。",
  ["Saves a diagnostic report to your device storage. The report contains device model, TTS engine status, and audio configuration — no personal data or book content. Share it when reporting issues on GitHub."] = "将诊断报告保存到设备存储。报告包含设备型号、TTS 引擎状态和音频配置——不含任何个人数据或书籍内容。在 GitHub 反馈问题时分享它。",
  ["No audio output available.\n\nThis Kindle model has a built-in speaker, but no working audio device was found.\n\nPlease generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue."] = "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n此 Kindle 机型有内置扬声器，但未找到可用的音频设备。\n\n请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub 问题页。",
  ["Downloaded.\n\nWeights & dictionary © ayutaz/sanoTTS-jp (release v1.0.0). Their usage terms (LICENSE-MODEL.md, NOTICE.md) were saved next to the voice. Select 'sanoTTS-jp (Japanese)' under TTS engine to use it."] = "下载完成。\n\n权重与字典 © ayutaz/sanoTTS-jp（v1.0.0 版）。其使用条款（LICENSE-MODEL.md、NOTICE.md）已随语音一同保存。在 TTS 引擎下选择“sanoTTS-jp（日语）”即可使用。",
  ["Connected to %1.\n\nNote: no Bluetooth audio sink was detected on this device. Audio may play through the internal speaker only.\n\nIf you hear no sound, your device model may not support Bluetooth audio streaming."] = "已连接 %1。\n\n注意：未在此设备上检测到蓝牙音频接收端，音频可能仅通过内置扬声器播放。\n\n若听不到声音，你的设备型号可能不支持蓝牙音频流。",
  ["Starting TTS benchmark...\n\nThis will synthesize several test sentences with each available TTS engine. On slow devices, Piper tests may take several minutes.\n\nThe screen may appear unresponsive during synthesis."] = "正在开始 TTS 基准测试…\n\n将使用每个可用 TTS 引擎合成若干测试句。在较慢的设备上，Piper 测试可能耗时数分钟。\n\n合成期间屏幕可能看似无响应。",
  ["When enabled (default), read-aloud pauses while a KOReader menu or dialog is open and resumes when it closes. When disabled, narration keeps playing while you browse menus; only the sentence highlighting pauses."] = "启用（默认）时，朗读会在 KOReader 菜单或对话框打开期间暂停，关闭后继续。关闭时，浏览菜单期间旁白继续播放；仅句子高亮暂停。",
  ["Not enough free storage for the update.\n\nNeeded: about %1 MB (update package plus installation workspace)\nAvailable: %2 MB\n\nFree up space (e.g. delete books or files via USB, or clean KOReader's cache), then try again."] = "存储空间不足以完成更新。\n\n需要：约 %1 MB（更新包加安装工作区）\n可用：%2 MB\n\n请清理空间（例如通过 USB 删除图书或文件，或清理 KOReader 缓存），然后重试。",
  ["Could not power on Bluetooth.\n\nOn some Kobo models, the Bluetooth hardware must first be initialized by the stock reading software. Please exit KOReader, pair your headphones in the Kobo library, then return to KOReader."] = "无法开启蓝牙。\n\n在某些 Kobo 机型上，蓝牙硬件需先由原生阅读软件初始化。请退出 KOReader，在 Kobo 书库中完成耳机配对，再返回 KOReader。",
  ["Routes to the same PocketBook audio daemon output as tts_sm but skips the softvol layers that crash on some firmwares. Try this if tts_sm produces no sound or playback stops with an error. Loses the system TTS volume control."] = "路由到与 tts_sm 相同的 PocketBook 音频守护进程输出，但跳过在某些固件上崩溃的 softvol 层。若 tts_sm 无声或播放报错停止，可尝试此项。会失去系统 TTS 音量控制。",
  ["Storage is full: the download stopped at %1 MB because the device has no free space left.\n\nFree up space (e.g. delete books or files via USB, or clean KOReader's cache), then try again. The download will resume where it stopped."] = "存储已满：下载在 %1 MB 处停止，因为设备已无剩余空间。\n\n请清理空间（例如通过 USB 删除图书或文件，或清理 KOReader 缓存），然后重试。下载将从停止处继续。",
  ["Experimental: when enabled, the playback control bar disappears while TTS is playing so the bottom of the page is fully visible for read-along. Pause playback (via tap-to-pause overlay or BT headset button) to bring the bar back."] = "实验性：启用后，TTS 播放时播放控制栏消失，页面底部完整可见以便跟读。通过点击暂停浮层或蓝牙耳机按键暂停播放即可让控制栏重新出现。",
  ["Runs a standardized TTS benchmark on test sentences using each available engine (espeak-ng, Piper). Saves a report you can share on GitHub to help document device performance. Piper tests may take several minutes on slow devices."] = "用每种可用引擎（espeak-ng、Piper）对测试句运行标准化 TTS 基准测试。保存的报告可分享到 GitHub，帮助记录设备性能。在较慢设备上 Piper 测试可能耗时数分钟。",
  ["When enabled, closing the case/cover will not stop audio playback. When disabled (default), playback pauses on lid close and resumes when reopened. Disabling prevents device crashes caused by audio processes running during hardware suspend."] = "启用后，合上保护壳/翻盖不会停止音频播放。关闭（默认）时，合盖暂停播放，重新打开后继续。关闭可防止音频进程在硬件挂起期间运行导致设备崩溃。",
  ["Cannot play this audio file. Kindle's GStreamer can only play raw PCM WAV files; MP3/M4B/AAC files need the bundled ffmpeg decoder. Please install the release .zip (not 'Source code') from GitHub so plugins/audiobook.koplugin/bin/ffmpeg is present."] = "无法播放此音频文件。Kindle 的 GStreamer 只能播放原始 PCM WAV 文件；MP3/M4B/AAC 文件需要自带的 ffmpeg 解码器。请从 GitHub 下载发布的 .zip（而非“Source code”），以确保 plugins/audiobook.koplugin/bin/ffmpeg 存在。",
  ["Piper neural TTS could not keep up on this device: %1.\n\nSwitching to espeak for the rest of this session. Piper will be tried again the next time you start playback. To keep espeak permanently, select it in:\n  Audiobook > Voice settings > TTS engine"] = "Piper 神经网络 TTS 在此设备上跟不上：%1。\n\n本次会话剩余部分将切换到 espeak。下次开始播放时会再次尝试 Piper。若要永久使用 espeak，请在以下位置选择：\n  有声书 > 语音设置 > TTS 引擎",
  ["Still waiting for %1 after 12 seconds.\n\nOn-device neural voices (SherpaTTS, VoxSherpa TTS, and similar) often run slower than real time on this e-reader. If nothing plays, this device is probably not suited to that TTS engine; try another system voice."] = "等待 %1 已超过 12 秒。\n\n本机神经网络语音（SherpaTTS、VoxSherpa TTS 等）在此电子阅读器上常慢于实时。若仍无声音，此设备可能不适合该 TTS 引擎，请尝试其他系统语音。",
  ["No audio output available.\n\nThis device has no built-in speaker. Please connect a Bluetooth audio device first:\n\n1. Go to Audiobook > Bluetooth settings > Bluetooth\n2. Turn Bluetooth on\n3. Scan and pair your headphones/speaker\n4. Then start read-along again."] = "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n此设备没有内置扬声器，请先连接蓝牙音频设备：\n\n1. 进入 有声书 > 蓝牙设置 > 蓝牙\n2. 开启蓝牙\n3. 扫描并配对你的耳机/音箱\n4. 然后重新开始跟读。",
  ["When enabled, play/pause/next/prev buttons on a Bluetooth headset or speaker will control playback. The connected device will also show playback status.\n\nOn Kindle, stem clicks are read from Lab126 LIPC (playermgr / audiomgrd) because this firmware has no AVRCP evdev node."] = "启用后，蓝牙耳机或音箱上的播放/暂停/上一首/下一首按键将控制播放，连接设备也会显示播放状态。\n\n在 Kindle 上，按键事件通过 Lab126 LIPC（playermgr / audiomgrd）读取，因为此固件没有 AVRCP evdev 节点。",
  ["No audio output available.\n\nNo working audio path was found on this PocketBook.\n\nTry changing the audio device:\nAudiobook > Audio device settings > System player (InkView)\n\nIf that does not help, generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub."] = "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n在此 PocketBook 上未找到可用的音频路径。\n\n尝试更改音频设备：\n有声书 > 音频设备设置 > 系统播放器（InkView）\n\n若无改善，请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub。",
  ["\n\nThis is often a system library compatibility issue. Try connecting Bluetooth headphones via Kindle Settings, switch to the espeak backend (Tools → Audiobook → Voice settings → TTS engine), or generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue."] = "\n\n这通常是系统库兼容性问题。请尝试在 Kindle 设置中连接蓝牙耳机、切换到 espeak 后端（工具 → 有声书 → 语音设置 → TTS 引擎），或生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub 问题页。",
  ["No audio output available.\n\nKindle has no built-in speaker. Audio needs Bluetooth headphones connected via Kindle Settings.\n\nPlease generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue -- it will help identify the correct audio path for this Kindle model."] = "没有可用的音频输出。\n\nKindle 没有内置扬声器，音频需通过 Kindle 设置连接蓝牙耳机。\n\n请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub 问题页——这有助于确定此 Kindle 机型的正确音频路径。",
  ["PocketBook devices route audio through different paths depending on firmware. The default works on most devices. Change this only if you hear no sound, distorted sound, or playback at 2-3x speed (known issue on PB631). Each option in the submenu has its own help text describing what to try."] = "PocketBook 设备会根据固件通过不同路径输出音频。默认值在多数设备上可用。仅在出现无声、声音失真或 2-3 倍速播放（PB631 已知问题）时再更改。子菜单各项自带说明文字，提示该尝试哪种。",
  ["When enabled (default), the book view auto-turns to keep the current narration sentence on screen while you stay with the read-aloud. Manually turning a page never seeks or restarts audio: highlighting pauses and a “Return to read-aloud” cue appears until you jump back or the narration catches up."] = "启用（默认）时，跟读期间书页视图自动翻页，使当前旁白句子保持在屏幕上。手动翻页不会跳转或重启音频：高亮暂停并显示“返回跟读”提示，直到你跳回或旁白追上。",
  ["Kindle + AirPods: when enabled, each playlist/Storyteller audio-file boundary runs a Bluetooth Disconnect→Connect cycle before the next file starts (~5–10 s gap). Off by default; the plugin still keeps a silent A2DP keepalive across the gap. Turn this on only if audio goes silent at chapter/chunk transitions."] = "Kindle + AirPods：启用后，每个播放列表/Storyteller 音频文件边界在下一文件开始前会执行一次蓝牙“断开→连接”循环（约 5–10 秒间隔）。默认关闭；插件仍会在间隔期间保持静默的 A2DP 保活。仅当章节/片段切换时音频静音才开启此项。",
  ["No TTS engine available on this device.\n\nThe Android TTS helper (.dex) was not found at the expected path.\n\nPlease verify that tts_helper.dex exists inside the plugin's android/ folder.\n\nAs a workaround, install espeak-ng via Termux:\n  pkg install espeak-ng\n\nThen add Termux to your PATH before launching KOReader."] = "此设备没有可用的 TTS 引擎。\n\n未在该预期路径找到 Android TTS 辅助程序（.dex）。\n\n请确认插件 android/ 文件夹内存在 tts_helper.dex。\n\n临时办法：通过 Termux 安装 espeak-ng：\n  pkg install espeak-ng\n\n然后在启动 KOReader 前将其加入 PATH。",
  ["Before the report runs: if you can, turn on VoiceView (the screen reader) and let it read a few sentences.\n\nThat lets the report capture how the Kindle's own voice works, which helps diagnose audio problems on newer models. The report takes about a minute.\n\nTap Continue when ready, or Skip to proceed without this."] = "在生成报告前：如果可以，请开启 VoiceView（屏幕阅读器）并让它朗读几句。\n\n这样报告能记录 Kindle 自身语音的工作方式，有助于诊断较新型号的音频问题。报告大约需要一分钟。\n\n准备好后点“继续”，或点“跳过”直接进入下一步。",
  ["When enabled, the plugin writes this book’s bottom page margin into KOReader’s own settings before CRE typesets. The next open rebuilds the layout once (text stays above the audiobook bar); after that, KOReader reuses that layout. Disable to restore your original margins and edit them with KOReader’s usual controls."] = "启用后，插件在 CRE 排版前将此书的底部页边距写入 KOReader 自身设置。下次打开会重建一次版式（文字位于有声书栏之上）；之后 KOReader 复用该版式。关闭可恢复你的原始页边距并用 KOReader 常规控件调整。",
  ["When enabled, the progress bar row is left out of the control bar during TTS read-along, making the bar one row shorter and leaving more of the page visible. The sentence highlight already shows how far along the page you are. The progress bar is always shown for audiobook playback, where it doubles as the seek control."] = "启用后，跟读控制栏中不含进度条一行，使控制栏减少一行、露出更多页面内容。句子高亮已能显示当前进度。有声书播放时进度条始终显示，并兼作拖动定位控件。",
  ["No audio output available.\n\nKindle has no built-in speaker. Please connect Bluetooth headphones via Kindle Settings, then try again.\n\nIf you already have headphones connected, please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub — it will help identify the correct audio path for this Kindle model."] = "没有可用的音频输出。\n\nKindle 没有内置扬声器，请通过 Kindle 设置连接蓝牙耳机后重试。\n\n若你已连接耳机，请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub——这有助于确定此 Kindle 机型的正确音频路径。",
  ["Failed to power on Bluetooth.\n\nOn some Kobo models, the Bluetooth hardware must first be initialized by the stock reading software. Please exit KOReader, pair your headphones in the Kobo library, then return to KOReader.\n\nIf Bluetooth was already working in the Kobo library, generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub."] = "开启蓝牙失败。\n\n在某些 Kobo 机型上，蓝牙硬件需先由原生阅读软件初始化。请退出 KOReader，在 Kobo 书库中完成耳机配对，再返回 KOReader。\n\n若蓝牙在 Kobo 书库中本可正常使用，请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub。",
  ["No audio output available.\n\nKindle has no built-in speaker. Audio needs Bluetooth headphones connected via Kindle Settings.\n\nThe Kindle audio subsystem did not expose a usable ALSA device. Please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue -- it will help identify the correct audio path for this Kindle model."] = "没有可用的音频输出。\n\nKindle 没有内置扬声器，音频需通过 Kindle 设置连接蓝牙耳机。\n\nKindle 音频子系统未暴露可用的 ALSA 设备。请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub 问题页——这有助于确定此 Kindle 机型的正确音频路径。",
  ["When enabled, the minimized read-aloud mini player sits above KOReader’s bottom status bar / progress bar (alt status bar at the top is unchanged). The page always reflows so book text ends above the mini player — the player never covers readable text. When disabled (default), the mini player sits at the bottom of the screen (may cover the status bar) but text is still reflowed above it."] = "启用后，最小化的跟读迷你播放器位于 KOReader 底部状态栏/进度条之上（顶部备用状态栏不变）。页面始终重排，使书文结束于迷你播放器之上——播放器绝不遮挡可读文字。关闭（默认）时，迷你播放器位于屏幕底部（可能遮挡状态栏），但文字仍重排于其上方。",
  ["No TTS engine found.\n\nVoice model files were found but the TTS binaries (espeak-ng, piper) are missing.\n\nPlease download the .zip file (audiobook-koplugin-v*.zip) from:\nhttps://github.com/stradichenko/audiobook.koplugin/releases/latest\n\nDo not download 'Source code' -- it does not include the TTS engines.\n\nIf you already installed from the .zip, please generate a bug report from the plugin menu and post it on GitHub."] = "未找到 TTS 引擎。\n\n找到了语音模型文件，但缺少 TTS 程序（espeak-ng、piper）。\n\n请从以下地址下载 .zip 文件（audiobook-koplugin-v*.zip）：\nhttps://github.com/stradichenko/audiobook.koplugin/releases/latest\n\n不要下载“Source code”——它不包含 TTS 引擎。\n\n如果你已从 .zip 安装，请从插件菜单生成错误报告并发布到 GitHub。",
  ["Kindle audio playback failed.\n\nThis Kindle model's GStreamer installation cannot decode audio files (no wavparse plugin). Audio may work if:\n\n1. You have connected Bluetooth headphones via Kindle Settings\n2. VoiceView is enabled (Settings > Accessibility > VoiceView)\n3. You switch to espeak TTS backend (Audiobook > Voice settings > TTS engine)\n\nPlease generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub."] = "Kindle 音频播放失败。\n\n此 Kindle 机型的 GStreamer 无法解码音频文件（缺少 wavparse 插件）。在以下情况下可能可用：\n\n1. 已通过 Kindle 设置连接蓝牙耳机\n2. 已开启 VoiceView（设置 > 辅助功能 > VoiceView）\n3. 切换到 espeak TTS 后端（有声书 > 语音设置 > TTS 引擎）\n\n请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub。",
  ["By default, PocketBooks with a Bluetooth adapter only play through Bluetooth audio, because direct hardware access can damage the amplifier. This toggle lifts the Bluetooth requirement ONLY for daemon-routed devices (tts_sm, hwout_mix), which go through the PocketBook audio daemon like the system's own TTS and never touch the hardware directly. Direct-hardware choices (plughw:0) remain blocked without Bluetooth. Use at your own risk."] = "默认情况下，带蓝牙适配器的 PocketBook 仅通过蓝牙音频播放，因为直接访问硬件可能损坏放大器。此开关仅对经守护进程路由的设备（tts_sm、hwout_mix）解除蓝牙限制——它们经由 PocketBook 音频守护进程，与系统自带 TTS 一样，从不直接接触硬件。直接硬件选项（plughw:0）在无蓝牙时仍被禁止。请自行承担风险使用。",
  ["No audio output available.\n\nThis Kindle has no built-in speaker, so audio must play over Bluetooth, and the plugin could not find a working audio route.\n\nTry this:\n1. Pair and connect Bluetooth headphones from the Kindle top-swipe menu (Settings), then start read-along again.\n2. If they are already connected, restart KOReader so the plugin re-detects the audio output.\n\nIf it still fails, generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue."] = "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n此 Kindle 没有内置扬声器，音频必须经蓝牙播放，而插件未能找到可用的音频路由。\n\n请尝试：\n1. 从 Kindle 顶部下滑菜单（设置）配对并连接蓝牙耳机，再重新开始跟读。\n2. 若已连接，请重启 KOReader，让插件重新检测音频输出。\n\n若仍失败，请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub 问题页。",
  ["Kindle audio playback failed.\n\nThe playermgr service accepted commands but audio never started.\n\nPossible causes:\n1. GStreamer cannot find the wavparse plugin on this firmware\n2. audiomgrd denied audio focus to the plugin\n3. No audio sink is configured (built-in speaker absent, BT not connected)\n\nTry: Connect Bluetooth headphones via Kindle Settings first, then start read-along.\n\nIf this persists, please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub."] = "Kindle 音频播放失败。\n\nplayermgr 服务接受了命令但音频始终未启动。\n\n可能原因：\n1. 此固件的 GStreamer 找不到 wavparse 插件\n2. audiomgrd 拒绝向插件授予音频焦点\n3. 未配置音频接收端（无内置扬声器，且未连接蓝牙）\n\n尝试：先在 Kindle 设置中连接蓝牙耳机，再开始跟读。\n\n若问题依旧，请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub。",
  ["Workaround for Android devices where read-aloud audio cuts off mid-sentence and stalls (seen on some MTK e-readers). Plays synthesized audio through one persistent, continuously-fed audio track instead of a fresh media player per sentence. Leave this off for neural engines such as SherpaTTS: the persistent stream adds hiss and pitch artifacts. Off by default; the plugin also switches to it automatically for the rest of the session when it detects a stalled clip, except on neural engines. Takes effect from the next sentence."] = "针对部分 Android 设备朗读音频在句中中断并卡住的 workaround（见于某些 MTK 电子书阅读器）。通过一条持续供音的音频轨道播放合成音频，而非每句新建媒体播放器。神经语音引擎（如 SherpaTTS）请保持关闭：持续流会引入嘶嘶声和音高失真。默认关闭；插件在检测到音频片段卡住时（神经引擎除外）也会在本会话剩余时间自动切换至此。从下一句起生效。",
}

local context = {}

return {
